title: "GH-1203: Offer actionable acceptance-evidence backfill after a warning close"
description: "Improve the reported warning-close then already-terminal refusal sequence with an executable recovery command. Existing warn/require policy and atomic structured close evidence are shipped contracts; preserve them. A normal pm update can append missing expected_result and actual_result while keeping the item terminal. Do not imply that force, reopen, or rewriting the original close event is required."
